### Neon Pages — HTTP smoke tests (REST Client / IntelliJ or curl)
# Target the running stack. Requires a seeded DB (admin/demo accounts).
# Execute with VSCode "REST Client" (rest-client), or run the bundled curl script.

@base = http://localhost
@api = {{base}}/api/v1

### 0. Health
GET {{api}}/health

### 1. Login as demo user (expect 200 + tokens)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo", "password": "User@12345", "captcha": "ABCD" }

### 2. Who am I (use access token from login)
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Rate limiting / wrong password (expect 401; repeat 5x → 403 lock)
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo", "password": "WrongPass1!", "captcha": "ABCD" }

### 4. Admin login
# @name adminlogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin@12345", "captcha": "ABCD" }

### 5. Admin stats (expect 200)
GET {{api}}/admin/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminlogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6. Admin list users
GET {{api}}/admin/users?page=1&limit=10&search=demo
Authorization: Bearer {{adminlogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7. Public page (no auth) — user must have created /p/welcome
GET {{api}}/p/welcome

### 8. SQLi probe (should NOT be a 500 / data leak)
GET {{api}}/p/' OR '1'='1

### 9. XSS probe via create page content (later assert stored-escaped)
PATCH {{api}}/pages/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "<script>alert(1)</script>Safe" }

### 10. Logout
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}